# The ON badge on the toolbar icon went blank whenever the tab finished loading after the extension had reported in: a slow page, or a single-page app changing its address. Background asked the page again and no one answered.
pages/badge-after-load.html
expect-badge:ON
eval:location.hash = 'sent'
wait:1000
expect-badge:ON
key:Escape
expect-badge:
key:Escape
expect-badge:ON
